  <para style="h">2 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya kabiri ryanditswe na Petero</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya kabiri ryanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petero</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Jewe Simoni Petero, umukozi n’intumwa ya Yesu Kristo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="2PE 1:1">Ndabandikiye mwebwe mwakiriye ukwizera kw’agaciro nk’ukwacu biciye mu kugororoka kw’Imana yacu n’Umukiza Yesu Kristo:<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ubuntu n’amahoro bibe muri mwebwe bisesekaye, ivyo muronkeshwa no kumenya Imana na Yesu Umwami wacu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuhamagaro n’ugutoranywa vy’Abakristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Ubushobozi bw’ubumana bwiwe bwaduhaye ivya nkenerwa vyose kugira ngo tubeho twubaha Imana biciye mu kumenya uwaduhamagaje ubwiza bwiwe n’ukugira neza kwiwe. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ni muri ivyo nyene yaduhereye amasezerano yiwe ahambaye kandi y’agaciro kanini, kugira ngo muri vyo namwe mugire akamere k’Imana ngo muhunge muve mu kwononekara kw’iyi si kwazanywe n’ivyipfuzo bibi.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Kubera iyo mvo nyene, mugire umwete kugira ngo ku kwizera kwanyu mwongereko ingeso nziza, ku ngeso nziza mwongereko ubumenyi; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ku bumenyi mwongereko ukwirinda; ku kwirinda mwongereko ugushishikara; ku gushishikara mwongereko kwubaha Imana; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />ku kwubaha Imana mwongereko kugiriranira igishika; kugiriranira igishika mukwongereko urukundo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Kuko nimwagira ivyo muri mwebwe kandi bigashishikara kugwira, bizobarinda kuba imburakimazi no kuba ingumba mu kumenya Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ariko umuntu wese atabifise, abona hafi kandi ni impumyi. Yibagiye ko yogejwe ivyaha vyiwe vya kera.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Nuko rero bene Data, murushirize kugira ishaka ryo gukomeza ihamagarwa ryanyu no gutoranywa kwanyu. Kuko nimwakora ivyo, ntimuzokwigera mutsitara, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />kandi muzokwakiranwa igishika gikomeye mu Bwami budashira bw’Umwami n’Umukiza wacu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuvugishwa buva mu Vyanditswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ibi nzokwama ndabibibutsa, naho mubizi kandi mumaze gushinga imizi mu kuri mwigishijwe. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Nibaza ko ari vyiza kubibibutsa nkiri muri uru rusago ari rwo mubiri, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />kuko nzi ko vuba cane ngiye kuwamburwa, nk’uko Umwami Yesu Kristo yabimenyesheje. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Kandi nzogira umwete kugira ngo ninamara kugenda muze mwame muvyibuka.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ntitwakurikiye imigani yashizweho n’ubwenge bw’abantu gusa igihe twababwira ivyo kuza mu bushobozi kw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, ariko twebwe twari ivyabona, kuko twiboneye ubwiza bwiwe bw’akaburarugero. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Yahawe na Data Imana icubahiro n’ubwiza igihe ijwi rivuye mu bwiza burengeje ryavuga riti: “Uwu ni Umwana wanje nkunda cane kandi ampimbara.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 17:5">Matayo 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mariko 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luka 9:35</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Twebwe ubwacu twariyumviye iryo jwi rivuye mw’ijuru igihe twari kumwe na we kuri wa musozi wejejwe.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Kandi dufise n’ijambo ry’ubuvugishwa rirushaho kuba iryo kwizerwa. Namwe muzoba mugize neza nimwaryumvira, kuko rimeze kurya kw’itara rimurika ahantu hari umwijima, gushika umutwenzi ubonetse, aho inyenyeri yo mu gaturuturu izoserukira mu mitima yanyu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Ikirengeye vyose, mumenye ko ata buvugishwa bwo mu Vyanditswe Vyera bushobora gusigurwa nk’uko umuntu yigombeye, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />kuko ubuvugishwa butava mu gushaka kw’umuntu, ahubwo abavugishwa bavuga ibivuye ku Mana, barongowe na Mpwemu Yera.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Abigisha b’ibinyoma n’uguhona kwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Ariko harabayeho kandi n’abavugishwa b’ibinyoma badutse mu bantu, nk’uko no muri mwebwe hazokwaduka abigisha b’ibinyoma. Bazozana mu mpisho inyigisho z’ibinyoma zisambura, zihakana na Shebuja yabacunguye, abo bikwegere uguhona kwihuse. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Benshi bazokurikira inzira zabo z’ibiteye isoni, bakengere inzira y’ukuri. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Mu gukunda amaronko kwabo, bazobakuramwo inyungu bakoresheje amajambo y’uruhendo. Igihano cabo carateguwe kuva kera, kandi uguhona kwabo ntigutevye.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Kuko nimba Imana itihanganiye abamarayika igihe bacumura, ariko ikabaterera muri Gehinomu, mu minyororo y’umwijima gushika ku musi w’imanza. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Kandi nimba itihanganiye isi ya kera igihe yarekurira umwuzure ku bantu b’ico gihe batubaha Imana, ariko igakiza Nowa, umwigisha w’ivyo kugororoka, n’abandi ndwi gusa; <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />hanyuma kandi nimba yaraciriye kw’iteka ibisagara vya Sodomu na Gomora mu kubihindura umunyota, bigacika akarorero k’ibizoshikira abatubaha Imana; <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />ariko igakiza Loti, umugororotsi, yababazwa n’ibikorwa bibi vyakorwa n’abagarariji <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />(kuko uwo mugororotsi yaba muri bo, imisi yose, akama ababazwa mu mutima wiwe ugororotse n’ibikorwa vy’ubugarariji bakora abibona kandi avyumva). <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ivyo vyerekana ko Imana izi gukiza abayubaha ikabakura mu marushwa yabo, ariko kandi igashobora no kurindiriza abatayubaha kugeza ku musi w’imanza, aho izobahanira. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Izohana canecane abakurikira ivyipfuzo biva muri kamere k’imibiri yabo bagakengera ukuganza kwayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Abo bantu ni intagondwa n’abanyabwibone, kandi ntibatinya no gutuka ivy’icubahiro vyo mw’ijuru; <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />ariko n’abamarayika, mbere basumvya abo bantu inkomezi n’ububasha, ntibubahuka kuvuga nabi no kwagiriza abameze batyo imbere y’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Abo bantu bo, batuka ivyo badatahura. Bameze nk’ibikoko gusa, bitagira ubwenge, vyavukiye gufatwa no kwicwa, kandi abo na bo bazohona nka vyo.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Bazosubirizwa mu nkoko ibibi bakoze. Birabanezera gukora ibiteye isoni ku murango. Iyo musangira na bo mu gihe c’imisi mikuru, ni agatetereza n’agasembwa muri mwebwe, kandi banezerererwa ubwo bubeshi bwabo. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Kubera amaso yabo yuzuye ubusambanyi, ntibahaga gucumura, basuka imitima y’abadakomeye, bashize imitima ku nyungu mbi, bariko umuvumo w’Imana! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Barahevye inzira igororotse barazimira bakurikira inzira ya Balamu mwene Beyori, yakunze ingero mbi. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ariko yahanuwe n’indogoba (igikoko kitavuga) mu vyo yariko arakora bibi, aho yatura ikavugisha ijwi ry’umuntu maze igahagarika ubusazi bw’uwo muvugishwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Abo bantu bameze nk’amasoko yakamye n’ibicu bikubebwa n’umuyaga. Kandi babikiwe umwijima w’umuzitanya. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Kuko bavuga amajambo ata co amaze kandi yo kwishira hejuru, bagakoresha ivyipfuzo vy’ubusambanyi n’ivya kamere muntu, kugira ngo basuke abatarakomera, bakiva mu buzima bw’abagendera mu kinyoma. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Babasezeranira umwidegemvyo, ariko na bo ubwabo bakiri abagurano b’ivyonona (kuko umuntu wese ni umugurano w’ikimuganza ico ari co cose). <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ko bari barahunze bakava mu bibonona vy’iyi si babihawe no kumenya Umwami n’umukiza wacu Yesu Kristo, hanyuma bakongera kubohwa na vyo kandi bakaba baratsinzwe, ubu babaye babi kurusha ubwa mbere. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Icari kuba ciza kuri bo ni uko boba batigeze bamenya inzira y’ukugororoka, kuruta kuba barayimenye hanyuma bagatera ibitugu rya bwirizwa bari barashikirijwe. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Kuri bo wa mugani warashitse ngo: “Imbwa isubiye ku vyo idashwe,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Imigani 26:11</ref></char></char></note> kandi ngo: “Ingurube yari yogejwe isubiye kwivayanga mu vyondo.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Umusi w’Umwami Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Bakundwa, iri ni ikete rya kabiri ndabandikiye. Muri ayo yose uko ari abiri, nagomba gukangura imitima yanyu ngo mwiyumvire neza ku vyo nabandikiye. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Ndagomba kubibutsa amajambo yavuzwe kera n’abavugishwa n’Imana bera hamwe n’ibwirizwa ry’Umwami wacu n’Umukiza yabashikirije acishije mu ntumwa zabatumweko.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Ica mbere mukwiye kumenya ko mu misi y’iherezo hazoza abacokoranyi, bacokora ukuri kandi bagakurikira ivyipfuzo vyabo bibi. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Bazoba bavuga bati: “Ukwo ‘kugaruka’ yasezeranye kuri he? Kuva aho ba sogokuruza bapfiriye, vyose bihora uko vyamye ubwa mbere isi ikiremwa.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ariko biyibagiza ibigirankana ko amajuru yabayeho n’isi ikaremwa ikuwe mu mazi kandi igizwe n’amazi, biremwe n’Ijambo ry’Imana. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Mu nyuma, ayo mazi nyene ni yo yarengeye isi y’ico gihe arayihonya. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Bivuye muri iryo jambo nyene, amajuru y’ubu n’isi y’ubu bibikiwe kuzotongorwa n’umuriro, birindirijwe uwo musi wo guca imanza no guhonya abatubaha Imana.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ariko ntimwibagire iki kimwe, bakundwa: Ku Mwami umusi umwe ni nk’imyaka igihumbi, n’imyaka igihumbi ni nk’umusi umwe. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Imana ntitebeje gushitsa isezerano ryayo, nk’uko bamwe biyumvira ko iritebeje. Yihanganira mwebwe, kuko idashaka ko hari n’umwe aranduka, ariko ishaka ko bose bashika ku kwihana.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ariko umusi Umwami wacu azogarukirako uzoshika nk’igisuma. Amajuru azozimangana mu kwasana guhambaye cane; ibiri mu kirere bizotongorwa n’umuriro, kandi isi n’ibiri muri yo vyose bizocirwa urubanza.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />None ko ivyo vyose bizosamburwa nk’uko, mukwiye kumera mute? Mukwiye kwubaha Imana mu ngeso zanyu <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />mu kurindira uwo musi w’Imana no gukora ibishoboka ngo ushike vuba. Uwo musi uzotuma amajuru asamburwa n’umuriro, kandi ibiri muri yo bitongorwe n’ikibengebenge gikomeye c’umuriro. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ariko nk’uko Imana yasezeranye, twiteze ijuru risha n’isi nsha, aho ukugororoka kuzoba kwuzuye.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Nuko rero, bakundwa, ko murorereye ivyo, mugire umwete wo kuzosangwa mutagira umugayo, canke agasembwa imbere y’Imana mufitaniye amahoro na yo. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Mumenye ko ukwihangana kw’Umwami wacu ari agakiza, nk’uko umuvukanyi dukunda Pawulo na we yabibandikiye akoresheje ubwenge yahawe n’Imana. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Ni ko yama yandika mu makete yiwe yose, aho avuga kuri ibi. Amakete yiwe arimwo ibintu bigoye gutahura, ivyo abatazi vyinshi n’abatagira uburagamo bagoreka, nk’uko babigira no ku bindi Vyanditswe, ari vyo bizotuma bahona.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Nuko rero, bakundwa, ko musanzwe mubizi, mwame mugavye kugira ngo ntimuzimizwe n’inyigisho mbi z’abantu b’abagarariji ngo munyiganyige muve mu kibanza canyu. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ariko mukurire mu buntu no mu kumenya neza Umwami n’Umukiza wacu Yesu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18" />
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18" />
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Icubahiro kibe iciwe uhereye ubu n’ibihe bidashira! Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>